      "title": "Method details",
      "instruction": "In this section, the following topics are presented sequentially: the new formulation of the Weibull distribution and Weibull regression models, which differs from those in [14], parameter estimation for the Weibull regression (WR) model; testing of the WR model parameters; development of the WR model into the Geographically Weighted Weibull Regression (GWWR) model; parameter estimation for the GWWR model; and parameter testing for the GWWR model.",
